{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BrokenLore: ASCEND</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> centered on the final, desperate climb of <strong>REN and YUI</strong>, two famous Japanese rooftop climbers obsessed with surpassing their limits and feeding their fame. Their channel, <i>SKYLIMIT</i>, has turned them into icons among fans of illegal urban climbing, leading them to the <strong>Elysium Tower</strong> \u2014 the tallest skyscraper in Japan \u2014 for a nighttime ascent meant to become <i>\u201cthe ultimate video.\u201d </i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/820113cae3b15880fa5398f1f6287b37.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/820113cae3b15880fa5398f1f6287b37.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/820113cae3b15880fa5398f1f6287b37.mp4?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>As they rise higher, the ascent turns into a <strong>nightmare</strong>. A supernatural entity, the <strong>Rokurokubi</strong>, begins to manifest \u2014 a woman with a serpent-like neck and an ornate mask, haunting every shadow of the tower. But her presence is more than just supernatural terror: she embodies their deepest fears \u2014 the terror of being forgotten, of becoming ordinary, invisible, irrelevant.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/19e58da791a89c6181f852ded520ca7a.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/19e58da791a89c6181f852ded520ca7a.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Gameplay blends <strong>intense first-person horror</strong>, <strong>realistic free climbing mechanics</strong>, and <strong>stealth sequences</strong> where players must cling to narrow ledges, hide from the Rokurokubi\u2019s gaze, and plan each movement carefully to survive. Every breath, every handhold, every sound could mean life or death. Vertical exploration becomes a psychological and physical ordeal where the player\u2019s endurance mirrors the characters\u2019 mental descent.  <br>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/c3f96f4cda184f5e39eebf3d744acc29.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=798 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/c3f96f4cda184f5e39eebf3d744acc29.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/c3f96f4cda184f5e39eebf3d744acc29.mp4?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Ren and Yui, falling means more than dying \u2014 it means losing the spotlight, validation, and the only sense of identity they\u2019ve ever known.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/71d4c50dabada6ca04445d2606c9b5eb.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/71d4c50dabada6ca04445d2606c9b5eb.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/71d4c50dabada6ca04445d2606c9b5eb.mp4?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ASCEND</strong> tells the story of a climb that becomes an <strong>escape from oneself</strong>, where the only way to break free\u2026 might be to stop climbing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051470?t=1765420205","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/414e56b856e7ea999a398c53caf74382739c064b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765420205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/3b8b241ce0003b5c10d5a8bb2a3b3ed836be6a9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765420205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/3b8b241ce0003b5c10d5a8bb2a3b3ed836be6a9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765420205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BrokenLore: ASCEND</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror</strong> centered on the final, desperate climb of <strong>REN and YUI</strong>, two famous Japanese rooftop climbers obsessed with surpassing their limits and feeding their fame. Their channel, <i>SKYLIMIT</i>, has turned them into icons among fans of illegal urban climbing, leading them to the <strong>Elysium Tower</strong> \u2014 the tallest skyscraper in Japan \u2014 for a nighttime ascent meant to become <i>\u201cthe ultimate video.\u201d </i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/820113cae3b15880fa5398f1f6287b37.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/820113cae3b15880fa5398f1f6287b37.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/820113cae3b15880fa5398f1f6287b37.mp4?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>As they rise higher, the ascent turns into a <strong>nightmare</strong>. A supernatural entity, the <strong>Rokurokubi</strong>, begins to manifest \u2014 a woman with a serpent-like neck and an ornate mask, haunting every shadow of the tower. But her presence is more than just supernatural terror: she embodies their deepest fears \u2014 the terror of being forgotten, of becoming ordinary, invisible, irrelevant.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/19e58da791a89c6181f852ded520ca7a.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/19e58da791a89c6181f852ded520ca7a.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Gameplay blends <strong>intense first-person horror</strong>, <strong>realistic free climbing mechanics</strong>, and <strong>stealth sequences</strong> where players must cling to narrow ledges, hide from the Rokurokubi\u2019s gaze, and plan each movement carefully to survive. Every breath, every handhold, every sound could mean life or death. Vertical exploration becomes a psychological and physical ordeal where the player\u2019s endurance mirrors the characters\u2019 mental descent.  <br>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/c3f96f4cda184f5e39eebf3d744acc29.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=798 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/c3f96f4cda184f5e39eebf3d744acc29.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/c3f96f4cda184f5e39eebf3d744acc29.mp4?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For Ren and Yui, falling means more than dying \u2014 it means losing the spotlight, validation, and the only sense of identity they\u2019ve ever known.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/71d4c50dabada6ca04445d2606c9b5eb.poster.avif?t=1765420205\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/71d4c50dabada6ca04445d2606c9b5eb.webm?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/extras/71d4c50dabada6ca04445d2606c9b5eb.mp4?t=1765420205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ASCEND</strong> tells the story of a climb that becomes an <strong>escape from oneself</strong>, where the only way to break free\u2026 might be to stop climbing.</p>","developers":["Serafini Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051470/8c589ca9f69de24c4cf07777d0e2780763997aa3/header.jpg?t=1765420205","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"BrokenLore: ASCEND","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro